---
// FeedGrid.astro - Tehdit Akışı Izgarası (Sıfır Emoji)
---

<section class="feed-section">
  <div class="feed-header">
    <h2 class="feed-title">
      Tehdit Istihbarati Akisi
      <span class="feed-count-badge" id="feed-count">0 oge</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="feed-meta" id="last-updated-text">Guncelleniyor...</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tehdit Kartlari Izgarasi -->
  <div class="articles-grid" id="articles-grid">
    <!-- JS ile dinamik olarak doldurulur -->
  </div>

  <!-- Bos Durum (Empty State) -->
  <div class="empty-state hidden" id="empty-state">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
      <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
      <line x1="8" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11"></line>
    </svg>
    <h3>Eslesen tehdit istihbarati bulunamadi</h3>
    <p>Arama sorgunuzu degistirmeyi, aktif filtreleri kaldirmayi veya yeni bir tarama baslatmayi deneyebilirsiniz.</p>
    <button id="btn-empty-reset" class="btn-secondary">Filtreleri Temizle</button>
  </div>

  <!-- Yukleme Iskeleti -->
  <div class="loading-grid hidden" id="loading-grid">
    <div class="card-skeleton"></div>
    <div class="card-skeleton"></div>
    <div class="card-skeleton"></div>
    <div class="card-skeleton"></div>
  </div>
</section>
